{"id": 4108, "title": "Borrow One Dollar", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "borrow-one-dollar", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/4108_borrow-one-dollar.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["一个人走进一家银行，对经理说：\"我可以借钱吗？”经理回答：\"当然，只要有担保，借多少都是可以的。只要您支付6%的利息，一年后我们就会把做担保的东西还给您。”经理以为他会借很多，可是他却说：\"想借一美元。”并且拿出了一沓价值50万美元的票据，说：\"这些做担保可以吗？”", "经理奇怪地问：\"您有那么多钱，为什么还要借一美元呢？”", "那个人回答：\"这听起来好像很奇怪，其实我只是想以担保的形式把票据寄存在这儿，这样又安全又便宜。”"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["一個人走進一家銀行，對經理說：\"我可以借錢嗎？”經理回答：\"當然，只要有擔保，借多少都是可以的。只要您支付6%的利息，一年後我們就會把做擔保的東西還給您。”經理以為他會借很多，可是他卻說：\"想借一美元。”並且拿出了一沓價值50萬美元的票據，說：\"這些做擔保可以嗎？”", "經理奇怪地問：\"您有那麼多錢，為什麼還要借一美元呢？”", "那個人回答：\"這聽起來好像很奇怪，其實我只是想以擔保的形式把票據寄存在這兒，這樣又安全又便宜。”"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["yī gè rén zǒu jìn yī jiā yín háng， duì jīng lǐ shuō：\" wǒ kě yǐ jiè qián ma？” jīng lǐ huí dá：\" dāng rán， zhǐ yào yǒu dān bǎo， jiè duō shǎo dōu shì kě yǐ de。 zhǐ yào nín zhī fù 6% de lì xī， yī nián hòu wǒ men jiù huì bǎ zuò dān bǎo de dōng xi huán gěi nín。” jīng lǐ yǐ wéi tā huì jiè hěn duō， kě shì tā què shuō：\" xiǎng jiè yī měi yuán。” bìng qiě ná chū le yī dá jià zhí 50 wàn měi yuán de piào jù， shuō：\" zhè xiē zuò dān bǎo kě yǐ ma？”", "jīng lǐ qí guài de wèn：\" nín yǒu nà me duō qián， wèi shén me hái yào jiè yī měi yuán ne？”", "nà gè rén huí dá：\" zhè tīng qǐ lái hǎo xiàng hěn qí guài， qí shí wǒ zhǐ shì xiǎng yǐ dān bǎo de xíng shì bǎ piào jù jì cún zài zhè r， zhè yàng yòu ān quán yòu pián yi。”"], "english_paragraphs": ["A man walked into a bank and said to the manager: \"Can I borrow money?\" The manager replied: \"Of course, as long as there is a guarantee, you can borrow as much as you want. As long as you pay 6% interest, we will return the guarantee to you after one year.\" The manager thought he would borrow a lot, but he said, \"I want to borrow a dollar.\" He took out a stack of notes worth $500,000 and said, \"Can these be used as guarantee?\"", "The manager asked strangely: \"You have so much money, why do you need to borrow a dollar?\"", "The man replied: \"This may sound strange, but actually I just want to deposit the note here as a guarantee, which is safe and cheap.\""], "english_full": "A man walked into a bank and said to the manager: \"Can I borrow money?\" The manager replied: \"Of course, as long as there is a guarantee, you can borrow as much as you want. As long as you pay 6% interest, we will return the guarantee to you after one year.\" The manager thought he would borrow a lot, but he said, \"I want to borrow a dollar.\" He took out a stack of notes worth $500,000 and said, \"Can these be used as guarantee?\"\n\nThe manager asked strangely: \"You have so much money, why do you need to borrow a dollar?\"\n\nThe man replied: \"This may sound strange, but actually I just want to deposit the note here as a guarantee, which is safe and cheap.\"", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rén\" data-defn=\"person; people\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zǒu\" data-defn=\"to walk / to go / to run / to move (of vehicle) / to visit / to leave / to go away / to die (euph.) / to change (shape, form, meaning)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">走</span><span class=\"tr\">走</span><rt>zǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jìn\" data-defn=\"to go in / to enter / to put in / to submit / to take in / to admit\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">进</span><span class=\"tr\">進</span><rt>jìn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span c